<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
        步骤 3 / 7 · 怎么比
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        一条阶梯，不是一张排行榜
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>
        两个模型之间的差，可能同时来自三件事——函数形式、喂进去的特征、以及参数怎么估。一级台阶只动其中一件。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', letterSpacing: 0.8 }}>C1</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', letterSpacing: 0.8 }}>C2</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 44 }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 6 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B0</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>历史频率</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B1</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>+ Elo</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B2</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>有序 logit</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>独立泊松</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>B4</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EFF8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>Dixon–Coles，带时间衰减</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B5a</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>梯度提升树</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>B5b</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>+ 30 个特征</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#1A2230', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>B6</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#D6DCE5', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>去水后的市场</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>→</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 124, padding: '12px 8px', background: '#1A2230', borderRadius: 4, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>B6r</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#D6DCE5', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>重校准的市场</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>只有先验</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>更多信息、更大容量</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>基准，不是台阶</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 560 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>
                    <span style={{ color: '#D9534F' }}>C1</span> · B4 → B5a
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    同样的信息、同样的样本权重——只换模型类。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 560 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>
                    <span style={{ color: '#D9534F' }}>C2</span> · B5a → B5b
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    同一个学习器、同一组超参数——多 30 个特征。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            整条阶梯只有这两级确实只动一个因素，所以 C1 和 C2 是我们唯一给归因的差别。其余每一级都同时改了几件事——那些臂只并列报告。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · 统计机器学习 I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>第 32 组 · 3/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
